JOB OPPORTUNITY

Our client in the IT Consulting sector is seeking a Java Developer to join their team.

📍 Placement: Jakarta / On-site

Your Main Responsibilities
- Perform ad-hoc fixes or initial troubleshooting in the event of application issues and/or operational failures during Operating Hours;
- Provide support to application users by delivering solutions to reported issues to maintain operational continuity;
- Conduct operational monitoring of application service availability;
- Provide input on application fix assessments and test plans for remediation outcomes;
- Implement permanent fixes/solutions and prepare remediation reports;
- Ensure application deliverables and source code are delivered at high quality;
- Ensure system readiness for testing and assist with User Acceptance Testing (UAT)/testing of fixes;
- Develop test scenarios and provide input on creating test scenarios for remediated applications;
- Test remediated applications and verify they pass testing at a quality level ready for release/further testing;
- Execute system implementation procedures to ensure smooth rollout, and provide solutions and updates when issues arise, including during training and deployment;
- Provide technical support for patching, tuning, environment upgrades, and deployment of application bug fixes;
- Assist with testing for integration with other systems;
- Assist with migration processes (if applicable and required);
- Perform preventive activities necessary to maintain system reliability;
- Conduct system usage training for new users when required;
- Review/preview work results with the team and the Client/Stakeholder.

Qualifications
- Bachelor Degree of Informatics
- Minimum 3 years of experience in using Java

If you meet the qualifications and are interested in this opportunity, please send your updated CV to:
📧: Rahadian.praditya@persolapac.com

📌 Subject: Java Developer – [Your Name]

Only shortlisted candidates will be contacted.

Feel free to share this opportunity within your network!
